    .keywords = update, upgrade, new version, download, install
settings-update-not-checked = Not checked yet.
settings-update-checking = Checking…
settings-update-up-to-date = This is the latest version.
settings-update-available = Version { $version } is out.
settings-update-downloading = Downloading version { $version }: { $percent }%
settings-update-downloading-unsized = Downloading version { $version }…
settings-update-installing = Installing version { $version }; Bediz starts again when it is done.
settings-update-check-failed = The check did not work: { $reason }
settings-update-install-failed = Version { $version } was not installed: { $reason }
settings-update-unreachable = GitHub could not be reached; check the internet connection.
settings-update-no-release = GitHub did not offer a release of Bediz.
settings-update-signature = the download's signature or version does not match the release.
settings-update-busy = a screenshot, a recording or a Save as window is open; finish it and try again.
settings-update-settings-unsaved = a setting was still being saved; try again.
settings-update-installer = the installer could not be started.
settings-update-unexpected = something unexpected happened; the log has the details.
settings-update-check = Check for updates
settings-update-install = Install and restart
settings-check-for-updates = Check for updates when Bediz starts
    .keywords = automatic, update, privacy, GitHub, internet
settings-check-for-updates-detail = Asks GitHub for the latest version, which shows GitHub your IP address. An update is installed only when you choose to.
settings-section-about = About
settings-about = Bediz { $version }
    .keywords = version, about, privacy, telemetry, licence, license, logs, source, GitHub
settings-about-detail = Bediz sends nothing anywhere: no telemetry and no upload of its own. It goes online only to check for updates, when you ask or turn that on. Copied screenshots never reach the cloud clipboard.
settings-licences = Licence notices
settings-open-logs = Open log folder
settings-source = Source code on GitHub
settings-about-failed = That did not open: { $reason }
settings-licences-close = Close
settings-licences-missing = These notices are made when a release is built.
settings-save-failed = The setting could not be saved: { $reason }
settings-watch-failed = If a setting cannot be saved, this window will not show it: { $reason }
